#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BRAWLS
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BRAWLS"
msgid "允许宿敌互殴"
msgstr "Allow rivals to brawl"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BRAWLS_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BRAWLS_HINT"
msgid "宿敌之间的争执有几率升级成真的打起来：回合制互殴、点到为止（任一方掉到半血双双收手），宿敌互殴不会打死人（断粮相残是另一回事，见下）。默认关——想看好戏的自己开。屏蔽标记可以彻底禁止一对互殴；「戏剧强度」设为「安静」时即使打开也不会触发"
msgstr "Arguments between rivals can escalate into an actual fight: turn-based, and stopped short (both back off once either drops to half health) - rival brawls never kill (famine cannibalism is a separate matter, see below). Off by default; turn it on if you want the drama. A block mark bans brawling for a pair outright, and setting Drama intensity to Quiet disables it even when this is on."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BREAKDOWN_DRAMA
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BREAKDOWN_DRAMA"
msgid "把崩溃演成一场戏"
msgstr "Play breakdowns as a scene"

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BREAKDOWN_DRAMA_HINT
msgctxt "ONIAiSocial.STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BREAKDOWN_DRAMA_HINT"
msgid "复制人压力满格真的崩溃时（嚎啕大哭／尖叫／呕吐／暴食／砸东西／放电），同房间的人会停下来看着他，事后在关系里留下「我看过他最糟的样子」。接下来几个周期内，第一个过去找他说话／照顾他／跟他同桌吃饭的人，会把他从崩溃里拉出来——两人好感大涨，那个人自己吃一点压力。你也可以直接牵线钦点谁去。**不改任何数值**：崩溃频率、压力、死亡率全部照旧，这一项只加演出、记忆与那道出口。预设开启"
msgstr "When a duplicant's stress maxes out and they actually break down (ugly crying / screaming / vomiting / binge eating / smashing things / throwing sparks), everyone in the room stops to watch, and the relationship keeps a memory of it. For the next few cycles, the first person to talk to them, tend to them or share their table pulls them out of it - a large affinity gain for both, and a little stress for the one who went. You can also pick that person yourself with a matchmaking mark. It changes no numbers: breakdown frequency, stress and death rate are all untouched. On by default."

#. resolved-locale: en
#. STRINGS.SOCIAL.SETTINGS.BUTTON
